<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7189] ODBC: ODBC return weird names for tables created with DDL</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7189</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If the table has been created by the &lt;tt&gt;CREATE TABLE&lt;/tt&gt; statement, and then its metadata requested, returned names for tables are looking like the following:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;tt&gt;SQL_PUBLIC_TABLE_NAME_00112233_4455_6677_8899_aabbccddeeff&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Instead of:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;tt&gt;TABLE_NAME&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
